# The image copies only alembic.ini, docker-entrypoint.sh, migrations/ and app/ (see Dockerfile), but the whole
# directory is still sent to the builder as the build context. Keep local caches, environments and secrets out of it:
# an unreadable .pytest_cache in a working copy once failed the build.
# Patterns without **/ match at the root only, so app/ (static images and all) is never touched by the root ones.
.git
.github
.claude
.venv/
venv/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.tox/
.coverage
htmlcov/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
*.db
.DS_Store
graphify-out/
data/
dist/
docs/
tests/
infra/
teams-app/
tools/
/*.zip
/*.png
/*.jpg
/*.jpeg
